 <table width="100%" border="0" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" cellpadding="5">
  <tr>
    <td background="images/bg.gif"><font class=""><a href="modules.php?name=News&new_topic=4">TV</a></font><br><font class="testo_notizia" color="#000000"><b>[<a href="modules.php?name=&amp;file=categories&amp;op=newindex&amp;catid=2"><font class="esclusiva">EXCLUSIVE</font></a>] Madonna in Capital - M6 -Report Of The Show.</b></font></td>
  </tr>
  <tr height="1">
    <td  background="images/riga.gif"></td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td bgcolor="#FFFFFF">
	<div align=justify><font class="storytext"><P align=center><IMG src="http://www.m6.fr/images/emissions/capital/bandeau_haut.jpg" border=0></P>
<DIV><IMG src="/images/rombo.jpg" border=0>&nbsp;<U>Interviews with</U> :</DIV>
<DIV><STRONG>. Roberto Ciurleo</STRONG>, Antenna director of <STRONG>NRJ</STRONG> radio</DIV>
<DIV><STRONG>. Bert Padell</STRONG>, Financial adviser</DIV>
<DIV><STRONG>. Barbara Victor</STRONG>, Biographer</DIV>
<DIV><STRONG>. Steven Gaydos</STRONG>, Journalist at "<STRONG>Variety</STRONG>"</DIV>
<DIV><STRONG>. Florence Rajon</STRONG>, Biographer</DIV>
<DIV><STRONG>. Philippe Manoeuvre</STRONG>, Editor of "<STRONG>Rock and Folk</STRONG>" magazine</DIV>
<DIV><STRONG>. Maripol</STRONG>, Designer</DIV>
<DIV><STRONG>. Patrick Hernandez</STRONG>, Singer (excerpt&nbsp;TV News)</DIV>
<DIV><STRONG>. Fabien Lecoeuvre</STRONG>, Agent</DIV>
<DIV><STRONG>. Mark Kamins,</STRONG> DJ</DIV>
<DIV><STRONG>. Seymour Stein</STRONG>, Boss of&nbsp;<STRONG>Sire</STRONG> label</DIV>
<DIV><STRONG>. Georges-Claude Guilbert</STRONG>, Professor of university and biographer</DIV>
<DIV><STRONG>. Mario Ciccone</STRONG>, Madonna's brother&nbsp;(old and taped&nbsp;interview)</DIV>
<DIV><STRONG>. Edwige Pasquet</STRONG>, Director of collection of foreign authors, <STRONG>Gallimard</STRONG></DIV>
<DIV><STRONG>. Rick Ross</STRONG>, President of an&nbsp;association which fights against the sects, New Jersey</DIV>
<DIV>&nbsp;</DIV>
<DIV><IMG src="/images/rombo.jpg" border=0>&nbsp;The show started with "<STRONG>the kiss</STRONG>" with B. <STRONG>Spears</STRONG> and C. <STRONG>Aguilera</STRONG> at the MTV Awards.</DIV>
<DIV>
<DIV><IMG src="/images/rombo.jpg" border=0>&nbsp;Madonna's fortune is estimated at 500 millions dollars.</DIV>
<DIV><IMG src="/images/rombo.jpg" border=0>&nbsp;She has sold more than 130 millions of albums in 20 years.</DIV></DIV>
<DIV><IMG src="/images/rombo.jpg" border=0>&nbsp;The most interesting parts were with <STRONG>Fabien Lecoeuvre,</STRONG> <STRONG>Maripol</STRONG>, <STRONG>Seymour Stein</STRONG> and <STRONG>Roberto Ciurleo</STRONG>.</DIV>
<DIV>&nbsp;</DIV>
<DIV><FONT color=#ff0000><IMG src="/images/rombo.jpg" border=0>&nbsp;<U><STRONG>Barbara Victor </STRONG>and <STRONG>Steven Gaydos</STRONG></U> </FONT><STRONG><FONT color=#ff0000>:</FONT> </STRONG></DIV>
<DIV><STRONG>"Madonna incarnates the American dream".</STRONG></DIV>
<DIV><STRONG></STRONG>&nbsp;</DIV>
<DIV><FONT color=#ff0000><IMG src="/images/rombo.jpg" border=0>&nbsp;<STRONG><U>Fabien Lecoeuvre</U> :</STRONG></FONT></DIV>
<DIV>When she was in France, Madonna worked during <STRONG>one year </STRONG>in the <STRONG>North of France</STRONG>. It was the <STRONG>disco period</STRONG> and everything in Europe were happening there. <STRONG>"She worked hard everyday there</STRONG>", he said. It was in <STRONG>Lille</STRONG>. She lived in a small hotel vis-a-vis the station and earned only 3 500 Francs each month. <STRONG>Fabien Lecoeuvre</STRONG> already noticed her charm and her seduction game : <STRONG>"She loved to be liked. She absolutely wanted to seduce, near over the limite"</STRONG>. Madonna was <STRONG>20 years old</STRONG>. It's worth to notice that he named Madonna <STRONG>"Louise"</STRONG>&nbsp;during&nbsp;the interview.</DIV>
<DIV>&nbsp;</DIV>
<DIV><FONT color=#ff0000><IMG src="/images/rombo.jpg" border=0>&nbsp;<STRONG><U>Mark Kamins</U> :</STRONG></FONT></DIV>
<DIV>He told the story of the "<STRONG>Everybody</STRONG>" single we all know (she met him a club and so on...)</DIV>
<DIV><STRONG>"What she has (that others don't) is that she writes her songs"</STRONG>, he said.</DIV>
<DIV>&nbsp;</DIV>
<DIV><FONT color=#ff0000><IMG src="/images/rombo.jpg" border=0>&nbsp;<STRONG><U>Seymour Stein</U> :</STRONG></FONT></DIV>
<DIV><STRONG>"When I knew her, she was very poor. She was given nothing. She earned</STRONG> <STRONG>EVERYTHING."</STRONG>, he said.</DIV>
<DIV><STRONG>"The first deal was under 20 000 dollars and it was not a big deal but it was fair at that time".</STRONG></DIV>
<DIV><U>About her first single "<STRONG>Everybody</STRONG>" without her picture on it</U> :</DIV>
<DIV>It was decided by <STRONG>Seymour Stein</STRONG> himself :</DIV>
<DIV><STRONG>"Why not play the mystery so we could sell some recordings and&nbsp; see if the popular market catches on it too?".</STRONG></DIV>
<DIV>So that people didn't know who was the singer.</DIV>
<DIV><FONT color=#ff0000><U><STRONG>Mark Kamins </STRONG></U>adds</FONT><STRONG>&nbsp;:</STRONG></DIV>
<DIV><STRONG>"Maybe white, maybe black... we don't know, so I buy the record, you know".</STRONG></DIV>
<DIV><STRONG></STRONG>&nbsp;</DIV>
<DIV><FONT color=#ff0000><STRONG><IMG src="/images/rombo.jpg" border=0>&nbsp;<U>Madonna's supposed lies at the beginning of her career</U> :</STRONG></FONT></DIV>
<DIV>About her family, her father's job and the place they lived...</DIV>
<DIV>&nbsp;</DIV>
<DIV><STRONG><FONT color=#ff0000><IMG src="/images/rombo.jpg" border=0>&nbsp;</FONT><FONT color=#ff0000><U>Mario Ciccone</U></FONT></STRONG><FONT color=#ff0000><U>, Madonna's brother&nbsp;(old and taped&nbsp;interview</U>)</FONT> :</DIV>
<DIV>He didn't like at all her lies on the family...</DIV>
<DIV>&nbsp;</DIV>
<DIV><FONT color=#ff0000><IMG src="/images/rombo.jpg" border=0>&nbsp;<STRONG><U>Maripol </U>:</STRONG></FONT></DIV>
<DIV>She talked about :</DIV>
<DIV><IMG src="/images/rombo.jpg" border=0>&nbsp;the creation&nbsp;of&nbsp;her look that made her successful ("Holiday", ...).</DIV>
<DIV><IMG src="/images/rombo.jpg" border=0>&nbsp;<STRONG>"Like A Virgin"</STRONG> :&nbsp;Madonna's famous shocking appearance on TV</DIV>
<DIV><IMG src="/images/rombo.jpg" border=0>&nbsp;the movie <STRONG>"Desperately Seeking Susan"</STRONG> : she told Madonna to wear her own clothes to promote&nbsp;her look instead of wearing the old ones&nbsp;that they wanted her to wear in this movie</DIV>
<DIV>She showed several unseen photos of Madonna and her.</DIV>
<DIV>&nbsp;</DIV>
<DIV><FONT color=#ff0000><IMG src="/images/rombo.jpg" border=0>&nbsp;<STRONG><U>Bert Padell</U> :</STRONG></FONT></DIV>
<DIV>He managed her fortune during 15 years and made her buy several houses and a lot of art (Picasso, ...).</DIV>
<DIV>&nbsp;</DIV>
<DIV><FONT color=#ff0000><IMG src="/images/rombo.jpg" border=0>&nbsp;<STRONG><U>Roberto Ciurleo</U> :</STRONG></FONT></DIV>
